Messages # Messages One Inbox For Every Conversation
// Language Screen Done Next
// Collection / Data consent screen A quick note about your data We use limited device and app information to keep Messages fast, secure, and reliable, show ads that help keep the app free, and send you important notifications. Your messages, contacts, and personal conversations are not collected for analytics or advertising and remain on your device. What we use and why: • App usage information - such as the screens you open and features you use - to improve performance and user experience • Device and app identifiers - to save your preferences, improve app stability, and support notifications • General location based on your network - to understand usage trends and provide region-relevant features • Advertising identifiers - to display and measure ads that help keep the app free By tapping Agree & Continue, you agree to our Terms of Service and acknowledge our Privacy Policy. We collect only the information described above to improve the app, provide essential features, and support advertising. Your personal messages and conversations remain private. I agree to this data collection Agree & Continue Please agree to data collection to continue. Terms
// Default SMS Screen Set Default SMS Set this app as your default SMS app to keep all your messages organized, secure, and easy to manage. Set As Default SMS
// Default Screen Set Default App Set this app as your default Home launcher to enjoy a faster, cleaner, and personalized home screen experience. Set As Default App
// Intro Screen Smart Messaging Manage conversations efficiently with organized, secure, and instant messaging experience. Real-Time Chat Connect instantly through fast, reliable, and seamless real-time conversations daily. Contact Management Organize contacts effortlessly for faster communication and improved accessibility anytime. Chat Archived Securely store important conversations for quick access whenever needed later.
// Permission Dialog Please allow permissions from app settings Open Settings
