// Messages Screen Overlay Permission Required This app need overlay permission to show popup message windows. Required Permission Meesage permission is required to access your messages and send qiuck message. Contacts permission is required to access your saved contacts and quick call. Your conversation will appear here Allow Your contacts will appear here Search Messages All Unread Personal Transaction OTP Offer Blocked To move this conversation out of \'Blocking\' and get messages again, unblock Sender does not support replies This conversation blocked by you Enter Message Today Yesterday Message failed to send SMS permission is required to send messages
